{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31462","headline":"我思何所在 · 李羣玉","name":"我思何所在","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我思何所在，乃在阳台侧。\n良宵相望时，空此明月色。\n归魂泊湘云，飘荡去不得。\n觉来理舟檝，波浪春湖白。\n烟光浩楚秋，瑶草不忍摘。\n因书天末心，系此双飞翼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}